{"id":"23b675b1348a813e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-proof.md","title":"Proof","display":"df-proof — Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-proof","aliases":["92-df-proof"],"display":"df-proof — Proof","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]"],"source":"第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）","source_status":"原书有限证明定义的本地集合实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof — Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书有限证明定义的本地集合实现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-proof-—-Proof-$\\pi$\">df-proof — Proof <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma,A,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma,A,R)\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> (formal system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (formal-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (candidate proof and conclusion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}\\)</span> (definition-target proof relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}(\\pi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma,A,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_n)\\in(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\pi=\\langle\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_n\\rangle\\land\\psi_n=\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\psi_i\\in A\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_k)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}^k\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\bigl((\\langle\\psi_{j_1},\\ldots,\\psi_{j_k}\\rangle,\\psi_i)\\in R\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}(\\pi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma,A,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_n)\\in(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\pi=\\langle\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_n\\rangle\\land\\psi_n=\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\psi_i\\in A\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_k)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}^k\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\bigl((\\langle\\psi_{j_1},\\ldots,\\psi_{j_k}\\rangle,\\psi_i)\\in R\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal{F}(\\pi,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal{F}(\\pi,\\varphi)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>中的证明</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> : 证明序列</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : 公理集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : 推理规则集</li>\n<li>证明是从公理出发，通过推理规则得到的公式序列</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 保证末项存在；规则前提的索引全部严格小于当前行号</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本文是一般系统上的有限证明。代入原书 P.E./P.A. 三元组后得到其逐行有限证明；自然数编码必须另取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a> 的 # 序列编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-proof-—-Proof-$\\pi$","text":"df-proof — Proof $\\pi$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma,A,R)$ with $\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)$ (formal system, see [[92-df-formal-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FormalSys}$ (formal-system predicate, see [[92-df-formal-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本文是一般系统上的有限证明。代入原书 P.E./P.A. 三元组后得到其逐行有限证明；自然数编码必须另取 [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 的 # 序列编号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma,A,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormalSys}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in(\\Sigma^{<\\omega})^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}(\\pi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma,A,R)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\,\\exists(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_n)\\in(\\Sigma^{<\\omega})^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\pi=\\langle\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_n\\rangle\\land\\psi_n=\\varphi\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\psi_i\\in A\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_k)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}^k\\\\\n&\\hspace{58mm}\\bigl((\\langle\\psi_{j_1},\\ldots,\\psi_{j_k}\\rangle,\\psi_i)\\in R\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal{F}(\\pi,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rules}(\\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false}],"bytes":1876,"backlinks":[{"id":"